{{!-- 
  A Handlebars template to generate a README.md that describes
  an xstate-like state machine from a comprehensive JSON model.
  
  Usage:
  1) Provide the JSON model as the template input/context.
  2) This template will output a Markdown document describing
     the machine's structure, states, events, context, and more.
--}}

# {{id}}

{{#if rootNode.data.description}}
**Description**: {{rootNode.data.description}}
{{/if}}

---

## Top-Level Context

{{#each context}}
- **{{@key}}**: `{{this}}`
{{/each}}

---

## States Overview

{{!-- Recursively list states. We only use simple loops and conditionals. --}}

{{#each rootNode.nodes}}
### State: **{{data.key}}**

{{#if data.type}}
- **Type**: {{data.type}}
{{/if}}

{{#if data.description}}
- **Description**: {{data.description}}
{{/if}}

{{#if data.initial}}
- **Initial Sub-state**: {{data.initial}}
{{/if}}

{{#if data.history}}
- **History Type**: {{data.history}}
{{/if}}

{{#if data.entry}}
- **On Entry**:
  {{#each data.entry}}
  - **Action**: {{action.type}}
  {{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if data.exit}}
- **On Exit**:
  {{#each data.exit}}
  - **Action**: {{action.type}}
  {{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if data.invoke}}
- **Invoked Actors**:
  {{#each data.invoke}}
  - **Source**: {{src}}
  {{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if nodes}}
#### Child States of {{data.key}}
{{#each nodes}}
- **Key**: {{data.key}}
  {{#if data.type}}(type: {{data.type}}){{/if}}
  {{#if data.description}}
  - Description: {{data.description}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if data.entry}}
  - On Entry:
    {{#each data.entry}}
    - Action: {{action.type}}
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if data.exit}}
  - On Exit:
    {{#each data.exit}}
    - Action: {{action.type}}
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

---
{{/each}}

## Transitions

{{#each edges}}
- **Source**: `{{source}}` => **Target**: `{{target}}`
  - **Event**: 
    {{#if data.eventTypeData.type}}
      {{data.eventTypeData.type}}
      {{#if data.eventTypeData.delay}}
        (delay = `{{data.eventTypeData.delay}}`)
      {{/if}}
      {{#if data.eventTypeData.eventType}}
        (eventType = `{{data.eventTypeData.eventType}}`)
      {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
  {{#if data.guard}}
  - **Guard**: `{{data.guard.type}}`
  {{/if}}
  {{#if data.actions}}
  - **Actions**:
    {{#each data.actions}}
    - `{{action.type}}`
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}

{{/each}}

---

## Schemas

{{#if schemas.events}}
### Event Schemas
{{#each schemas.events}}
- **{{@key}}**: 
  {{#if this.properties}}
  Properties:
    {{#each this.properties}}
    - `{{@key}}`
    {{/each}}
  {{else}}
  *(No additional properties)*
  {{/if}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

---

## Implementations

{{#if implementations.guards}}
### Guards
{{#each implementations.guards}}
- **{{@key}}**:
  - ID: {{id}}
  - Name: {{name}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if implementations.actions}}
### Actions
{{#each implementations.actions}}
- **{{@key}}**:
  - ID: {{id}}
  - Name: {{name}}
  {{#if schema.properties}}
  - Schema properties:
    {{#each schema.properties}}
    - `{{@key}}: {{this}}`
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if implementations.actors}}
### Actors
{{#each implementations.actors}}
- **{{@key}}**:
  - ID: {{id}}
  - Name: {{name}}
  {{#if input.properties}}
  - **Input**:
    {{#each input.properties}}
    - `{{@key}}`
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if output.properties}}
  - **Output**:
    {{#each output.properties}}
    - `{{@key}}`
    {{/each}}
  {{/if}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}
